own; Tailscale was disconnected after the reboot and was reconnected by an agent
(`tailscale up`, human-approved) before the phone check. Whether Tailscale was
already disconnected before the reboot is unknown: its restart setting is
maintainCurrentState (io.tailscale.ipn.macsys com.tailscale.ipn.restartState),
